Z||000000||theogre||02-06-2001||07:38 PM||||In order to decrease the wasted space caused by MS Word 2k the site is being heavily reworked and may not be available at various times over the next week or two.<P>If anyone cares, I'm converting the entire mess to use cascading style sheets and editing some articles. This will likely cause me to do at least a couple global reloads of the site on the server. Doing a global post means I delete the existing post completely. This way all the stray files left from the conversion are removed. It's much easier to do this way than try to sort thru dozens of files and folders individually on the server.<P>------------------<BR><I><B>Screamin Yellow Zonkers... If it's Screamin and Yellow, I ain't eatin it.</B></I>||||reg||4
