Z||000003||theogre||02-07-2001||07:42 PM||||The site will be unavailable again for awhile tonight.<P>I've cut over 1/2 meg of data out. When you figure that is mostly text, that's a hell of allot of redundant crap.<P>CSS is suposed to work in slagging WebTV... If it doesn't there's not much I can do about it. Like everything else WebTV does, it has all kinds of rules that aren't all normal. The CSS is based on the embeded styles I used previously so they should still work.||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||02-09-2001||08:54 PM||||The rest of the conversion is completed and will be posted tonight. Saved about a 1/2 meg of space just in the fiero stuff. The Fiero cave now has a more consistant look.<P>Note, if anyone is using the IE channel feature, you will want to resync the pages. Also, the channel is no longer configured for auto update.||||reg||1
